        "question": "What is CryptoBingo?",
        "answer": "CryptoBingo is an on-chain bingo platform on the WAX blockchain. Every game is publicly verifiable and prizes are paid automatically to your wallet."
      },
      {
        "question": "How do I play?",
        "answer": "Connect your WAX wallet, choose a room, buy your tickets and wait for the draw. If you win, the prize is sent automatically."
      },
      {
        "question": "Are the draws fair?",
        "answer": "Yes. CryptoBingo uses the WAX randomness oracle (orng.wax), based on RSA-SHA256, whose output is verifiable on-chain by anyone."
      },
      {
        "question": "Which tokens can I use?",
        "answer": "WAX is the default token. Rooms can accept BINGO, TLM or other supported tokens. You can also use the swap feature to pay with alternative tokens."
      },
      {
        "question": "How does prize payment work?",
        "answer": "After the draw, the smart contract automatically evaluates all tickets and transfers prizes directly to winners' wallets."
